OL,3,GNEWSAScout band seeks to boost
OL,4,Amembership numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brass band is attempting to bolster
OL,7,Fits membership after experiencing a
OL,8,Fdrop in numbers.
OL,10,FJersey Scout Band has launched an
OL,11,Fisland-wide publicity campaign to find
OL,12,Fplayers aged eight and above as it
OL,13,Fdeals with a fall in musicians wanting
OL,14,Fto join the group.
OL,16,FA total of 12 players turned up to a
OL,17,Ftraining night on Thursday at Kenneth
OL,18,FFaucon Memorial Hall in St Saviour -
OL,19,Fthose who lead the band said there
OL,20,Fmight have been twice that number not
OL,21,Fso long ago.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
