OL,3,GNEWSAScout band seeks to boost
OL,4,Amembership numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe band, who have been performing
OL,7,Fsince 1970, said people who wanted to
OL,8,Fjoin and learn to play an instrument
OL,9,Fdid not have to be a Scout or Girl
OL,10,FGuide to do so.
